sistant Professor of Acting with expertise in Acting for the Camera, responsible for training students in stage and on-camera performance while preparing them for professional careers across theatre, film, television, and streaming through instruction in acting technique, industry practices, and career development. Assistant Professor Finance, Financial Planning, and Insurance #27-03 Academic Affairs 560645 The department of Finance, Financial Planning, and Insurance at California State University, Northridge (CSUN) is seeking a tenure-track faculty member in Financial Planning at the rank of Assistant Professor.\n\nThe successful candidate will primarily teach Financial Planning and have research interests in Financial Planning and related fields. The new hire is expected to be actively involved in our CFP Board-registered financial planning program. Assistant Professor of Organic Chemistry - Department of Chemistry and Biochemistry #27-02 Academic Affairs 560399 The department of Chemistry and Biochemistry at California State University, Northridge (CSUN) is seeking a tenure-track faculty member in Organic Chemistry at the rank of Assistant Professor. Assistant Professor - Department of Marketing #26-27 Academic Affairs 555736 The Department of Marketing at California State University, Northridge (CSUN) is seeking a tenure-track faculty member in Marketing at the rank of Assistant Professor.\nThe successful candidate will teach marketing courses—such as Consumer Behavior and Integrated Marketing Communications (IMC)—as well as other foundational courses as needed by the department, and have research interests and an active research pipeline in consumer behavior and related areas. Assistant Professor - Department of Business Law #27-01 Academic Affairs 558030 The department of Business Law at California State University, Northridge (CSUN) is seeking a tenure-track faculty member in 2027-2028 at the rank of Assistant Professor.  The successful candidate will teach b